{"3340820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Witch Stories", "steam_appid": 3340820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the 1700s. You are a woman living in a cottage in the forest with your husband and newborn baby. Your husband goes to work in town every day, and you deliver the goods of your farm to neighbors. Your story unfolds over one day, whether you choose to act or not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most choices, and lack thereof, will result in uniquely branching narratives, letting you tell your own Witch Story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, open world, branching dialog, voice acted, simple controls, and tons of easter eggs to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch doth dwell in yon tangled wood… </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the 1700s. You are a woman living in a cottage in the forest with your husband and newborn baby. Your husband goes to work in town every day, and you deliver the goods of your farm to neighbors. Your story unfolds over one day, whether you choose to act or not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most choices, and lack thereof, will result in uniquely branching narratives, letting you tell your own Witch Story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, open world, branching dialog, voice acted, simple controls, and tons of easter eggs to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch doth dwell in yon tangled wood… </p>", "short_description": "In Witch Stories, the forest doth whisper thy name, and the witch’s gaze falleth heavy upon thee. The world shall not wait, though thou choosest to act or abide still. From sunrise to sunrise, face trials dark and truths most grievous.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340820/header.jpg?t=1737281612", "capsu